    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nO'Donnellan & Joyce Auctioneers are privileged to offer for sale this substantial detached residence on a large private site in the popular & convenient Galway location of Newcastle Park.\n\nNo.21 Newcastle Park offers abundance of accommodation throughout with approximately 222 sq.m. \n\nOriginally constructed in 1940; the property will benefit from modernisation but has been well maintained by owners throughout the years. \n\nThe ground floor is arranged with via a large entrance hall leading to several living & reception space, guest bathroom, fitted kitchen & service area, and a large sunroom along the side of the house with impressive, vaulted ceilings. \n\nUpstairs is arranged between four sizeable bedrooms & a main family bathroom. \n\nAdditionally, a separate garage & covered forecourt are positioned adjacent to the residence. \n\nA key feature of 21 Newcastle Park is the outside space on offer & the potential that goes with. Offering a private green-hedge frontage with off-street parking, the grounds offer a large private garden with mature green surroundings. \n\nNewcastle Park is a popular residential location situated just off Lower Newcastle Road. \n\nThe ideal location across from Galway University & beside UCHG, whilst Galway City Centre & Dangan Sportsgrounds are within walking distance. \n\nAs expected from the location, amenities & services are within easy reach, and the area is a popular family locale given the proximity to quality local schools.\n\n21 Newcastle Park is an impressive property offering huge potential whether as a large family home in a central location or further development (STPP) given the plot size of the site.\n\nViewing is highly recommended.\n\nProperties can be viewed on our website www.odj.ie \n\nKeep up to-date with NEW PROPERTIES by registering your details on our database \n\nFor Further details please contact O'Donnellan & Joyce on 091-564212\nOFFICE OPENING HOURS - MON TO FRI 9AM TO 5:30PM\n\nNOTE: These particulars are not to be considered a formal offer. They are for information only and give a general idea of the property. They are not to be taken as forming any part of a resulting contract, nor to be relied upon as statements or representations of fact.\n\nFLOORPLANS: The floor plan including furniture, fixture measurements and dimensions are approximate and for illustrative purposes only. The Polycam App used gives no guarantee, warranty or representation as to the accuracy and layout. All enquiries must be directed to the agent.\n\nWhilst every care is taken in their preparation, neither O'Donnellan & Joyce Auctioneers nor the vendor accept any liability as to their accuracy. Intending purchasers must satisfy themselves by personal inspection or otherwise as to the correctness of these particulars.\n\nNo person in the employment of O'Donnellan & Joyce Auctioneers has any authority to make or give any representation or warranty whatever in relation to this property."
      },
      {
